### 1. 测试新增备忘录 (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/memos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试独立开发",
  "content": "我的后端终于跑通了",
  "tag": "后端"
}

### 2. 测试查询所有 (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/memos

### 3. 测试查询单个 (GET)
# 假设刚才新增的数据 id 是 1
GET http://localhost:8080/memos/1

### 4. 测试修改 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/memos/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "改过的标题",
  "content": "改过的内容",
  "tag": "修改"
}

### 5. 测试删除 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/memos/7

### 6. 测试删除 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/memos/2

### 7.测试按关键词搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/memos/search?keyword=后端

### 8.计算不同标签个数
GET http://localhost:8080/memos/tags

### 9. 不传参数（默认第1页，拿10条）
GET http://localhost:8080/memos/page

### 10. 只传页码（默认第2页，拿10条）
GET http://localhost:8080/memos/page?page=2

### 11. 自己定义（看第1页，只拿3条）
GET http://localhost:8080/memos/page?page=1&size=3